message: "If you use ExFuzzy Atlas, please cite it as below, and cite ex-fuzzy, the library it builds on."
type: software
title: "ExFuzzy Atlas"
abstract: >-
  An atlas of fuzzy rules over open environmental and urban data. It learns rules with the ex-fuzzy library and shows
  where and when each rule fires, on official geometries and with verifiable traces.
